    "description": "Loose Gemstones Mixed Color, Tumbled, Polished Stones Assorted Lot!\nColor\n: Multi-color\nDepartment\n: Jewelry & Gemstones > Loose Gemstones\nCategory\n: Jewelry & Watches\nWeight\n: 142.89 grams\nCondition\n: Good: Minor visible imperfections\nDescription\n: Add stunning color and a natural touch to any project or collection with this mixed lot of polished gemstones and mineral chunks. This bundle includes a vibrant variety of stones, each with a unique color and texture, weighing a total of 142.89 grams. The assortment features a range of shapes and finishesfrom glossy pinks and purples to deep reds, greens, blues, and metallicsmaking them perfect for jewelry making, crafts, display, or educational purposes.\nAll stones shown are included, and each piece has been tumbled and polished for smooth edges and a refined appearance. Their varied sizing and natural patterns add visual interest and versatile utility, allowing you to create custom designs, add to gemstone collections, or enjoy for metaphysical practices. The stones appear in good overall condition, with polished surfaces and no visible breaks. All items pictured are included, sold as shown.\nJEWELRY INFORMATION\n-Gold and silver is tested with a Thermo Scientific Niton DXL x-ray machine.\n-Gemstone sizes are approximate, we try to measure accurately, please refer to photo for details.\n-Gemstones are measured with a Presidium Duo II and does not distinguish between natural and synthetic gems and or materials.\n-Items are total weight. Some jewelry pieces may have attached pins, clasps, chains, or accent parts that are not precious metals included in this weight.\n-Displays used to stage product are not included in purchase.\nUSED ITEMS DISCLAIMER:\nPlease note that all items have been donated. All items are used and untested (including battery life & functionality), lots are unsorted, unless otherwise noted. We do our best to ensure the quality of all our auctions & describe them accur